## Coverage floor

{{COVERAGE_MIN}}%. Below it is not done.

## Rules

- A test that is skipped is a test that failed. Fix it or delete it and say why.
- Never weaken a test to reach green. If the test is wrong, fix the test and put
  one line in the commit saying what it had wrong.
- A bug fix comes with the test that would have caught it. That is what stops it
  coming back.
- Test behaviour, not implementation. A test that breaks on a rename was testing
  the rename.

